.SH NAME
voltkit\-ruler \- Measure distances on screen in pixels
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvoltkit ruler\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure distances on screen in pixels
.PP
Freezes the screen and shows it full screen. Drag to measure a width and height; hold Shift for a straight line. Ctrl+C copies the size, right\-click clears, Esc closes.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
